        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Schlage L9050 02A 619 EE214 Grade 1 Commercial Mortise Lock Sets with Escutcheon</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Schlage L series extra heavy duty mortise locksets conform to Federal Specification FF-H-106 Type 86. The latchbolt can be fully retracted with 35 degree lever rotation. They have a limited  <b>lifetime manufacturer's warranty</b>. The  Commercial Grade 1 Mortise Lockset comes with a Escutcheon Plate.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nComplies with ANSI A156.13-2012, Series 1000, Grade 1. UL Listed for 3-hour fire doors.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" alt=\"ADA Compliant Handicap Logo\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Schlage L Series Mortise Leversets:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Mortise Case: 4-7/16\" x 6-1/16\" x 1\". </li>\r\n<li>Armored Front: 8\" x 1-1/4\". </li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt: 1\" throw Stainless steel.</li>\r\n<li>Latchbolt: 3/4\" Throw Stainless Steel with Anti-friction tongue</li>\r\n<li>Door Prep: Fits standard mortise 86 door prep.</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Hand Case: Handed. Reversible in field.</li>\r\n<li>Front: 2-1/4\" X 1-1/8\" Beveled 1/8\" on 2\".</li>\r\n<li>Strike: 4-7/8\" x 1-1/4\" </li>\r\n\r\n<li>Overall Projection: 2-9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever: #2</li>\r\n<li>Rosette: A</li>\r\n\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Satin Nickel</b></li>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage C </li></ul>\r\n\r\n<p><b>***SPECIAL ORDER ITEM, NOT RETURNABLE***</b></p>",
